        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekiikaro eky'okuramizaamu kiri kimu kyonka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obumuliba muli omunsi MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkuru inywe ei arukwija kubaha mugirye, mugiikalemu ebiro byona ebi mulimara omunsi, binu nibyo biragiro n'ebigambo ebi mulitaho omutima kukwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiikaro byona, amahanga goona aga mulibinga ebi gaaramizaamuga embandwa zaago, ebinyakuli hansozi eziraihire na habusozi, na hansi eya buli muti omubisi, mubihwerekerereze kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amatambiro gaabo mugaseese, enyomyo zaabo mwicwacwane, embandwa yabo Asera mugicumike omurro; ebisisani byabo ebinyakubaizirwe ebyembandwa zaabo mubitemateme, muragalize kimu ibara lyabo lireke kugaruka kwijukwa omu kiikaro eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu inywe, ebi mutalibikora MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekiikaro MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu wenka eki alikoma omu nganda zanyu zoona kumanyisizaayo ibara lye n'okwikarayo, oku nuho mugendege, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuho muleetege ebihongwa byanyu eby'okwokya n'ebyonzira byanyu, nuho muleetege ebicweka byanyu ebya ikumi, ebihongwa byanyu ebi mwehongera inywenka, ebihongwa eby'okuragaana, eby'okwegondeza, emizigaijo ey'amagana ganyu ag'ente n'agembuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku, omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, nuho muliirege, nuho musemerererwege hamu n'amaka ganyu, nimusiima buli kintu kyona eki muraakoraga, MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu eki araabaga abaheeriiremu omugisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu byona ebi turukukora hanu kiro kinu, buli muntu kwekorra eki arukurora ngu nikyo ekihikire mutalibikora; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba ekihuumuro n'obugwetwa MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu ebi ali haihi kubaha, timukabihikiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu mulyambuka Yorudaani, mukaikara omunsi MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu ei ali haihi kubaha ebe bugwetwa, kandi obu alibahuumuza akabajuna abanyanzigwa banyu boona abanyakubeehinguliriize, nukwo mwikale n'obusinge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu, ekiikaro eki alikikoma kuramizibwamuga, oku nuho mumutwarrege byona ebi mbaragiire: ebihongwa byanyu eby'okwokya n'ebyonzira byanyu, ebicweka ebya ikumi, ebihongwa ebi muhonga inywenka, n'ebihongwa byanyu byona eby'okuragaana na MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musemererwege omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu, inywe, batabani banyu, bahara banyu abairu n'abazaana banyu, n'Abaleevi abanyakuli omumbuga zanyu, habwokuba bo, tibagira mugabo rundi bugwetwa hamu na inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyerinde ebihongwa byawe eby'okwokya, oleke kubihongeraga hoona h'okasangire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu omukiikaro kimu kyonka MUKAMA eki aliba akomere omu rumu ha nganda zawe oku nuho ohongege ebihongwa byawe eby'okwokya, binu byona ebi ndukukuragira nuho obikorrege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baitu noikirizibwa kwita n'okulya enyama ey'ebisoro ebinyakuli omumbuga zawe, nkooku orukwenda, MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe nkooku yakuhaire omugisa, abarukuzira n'abatarukuzira nibaikirizibwa kulya enyama egi, nkooku bakubaire nibalya enyama ey'ensirabo rundi ey'empara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 7:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10+LEV.17.11+LEV.17.12+LEV.17.13+LEV.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:10-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 15:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka otalikisura okalya esagama, ogiseesege nkooku oseesa amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumbuga zawe torukwikirizibwa kuliiramu ekicweka ekya ikumi eky'engano yawe, n'eky'amagita gawe, kuliraamu emizigaijo ey'amagana gawe ag'ente n'ag'entaama, rundi eky'ebimu ha bihongwa byawe eby'okuragaana, rundi ebihongwa byawe okwegondeza, rundi ebi ohonga wenka n'emikono yawe baitu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obiriirege, omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, omukiikaro ekyalikoma, nuho iwe, mutabani wawe, muhara wawe, omwiru wawe, omuzaana wawe, n'Omuleevi anyakwikara omumbuga zanyu; kandi kyona eki oraakoraga, okikolege noosemerererwa omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi koona akoolimara omunsi yawe, otalinagaija Omuleevi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe obu aligalihya ensi yawe nkooku yakunihiize, okagira oti: ‘Kandyeho enyama enu,’ ogirye nkooku orukwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiikaro MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe eki alikoma kuramizibwamu, obu kiriba kikuli hara, noikirizibwa kwita ezimu ha nte rundi ha ntaama MUKAMA ezi yabahaire, nkooku nkugambiire; kandi noikirizibwa kuliira omumbuga zawe nkooku orukwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogirye nkooku waakuliire ensirabo rundi empara. Abarukuzira n'abatarukuzira boona nibaikirizibwa kugirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10+LEV.17.11+LEV.17.12+LEV.17.13+LEV.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 17:10-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki oraafuuhizaaga kimu nikyo kulya esagama, habwokuba esagama nubwo bwomeezi, habweki, nikyo orukutangirwa kuliirana esagama omu nyama yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki otalikisura, esagama ogiseesege nkooku oseesa amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otaligirya; obu olikora ebihikire MUKAMA ebi asiima, nubwo olitunga omugisa n'abaana bawe, iwe otakyaroho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
