          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe obu alihwerekereza amahanga ago ag'orukugenda kwetungira, obwolimara kugatunga okagaikaramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otalitwalirizibwa kukora nk'ebigaakozire, habwokuba eki, kirirugwamu kagingo, obugalimara kuhwerekerezibwa otalikaguliiriza hali embandwa zaago oti: ‘Amahanga ganu gaaheerezaaga gata embandwa zaago, na nyowe nukwo nkole?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, otalimukora oti; habwokuba ekintu ekinugwa kyona MUKAMA ekyanoba, nikyo gaakoliire embandwa zaago habw'okuzitambira ebyonzira noobwakubaire batabani baabo na bahara baabo, bakabokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
